      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is warehouse-native product analytics?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Warehouse-native product analytics is a category of tools that run funnel, retention, and path analysis directly on the events already in your data warehouse (DuckDB, Snowflake, ClickHouse, Databricks, Postgres) — with no event ingestion pipeline and no duplication of data into a third-party SaaS."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Who is stratif.io for, and who is it not for?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "stratif.io is for teams whose product events are already in a SQL warehouse and who want self-hosted funnels, retention, and path analysis on that data. It is not a full-stack replacement for Mixpanel or Amplitude — it does not ship SDKs, experimentation, session replay, or push notifications."
      }
    }
  ]
